---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro"

const repository = "https://github.com/momobasehq/momobase"
---

<SiteLayout
  title="About Momobase"
  description="Why Momobase exists, what it is designed to do, and the principles behind the project."
>
  <main id="main">
    <article class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[908px] px-6 py-[clamp(5rem,10vw,8rem)] max-sm:px-4">
      <header class="max-w-[760px]">
        <p class="mb-5 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.12em] text-muted uppercase dark:text-muted-dark">About</p>
        <h1 class="text-[clamp(3rem,7vw,6rem)] leading-[0.98] font-medium tracking-[-0.065em]">Payment infrastructure should be understandable.</h1>
        <p class="mt-8 max-w-[680px] text-lg leading-8 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">
          Momobase is an open-source payment orchestration service for teams that want a unified provider layer without handing control of their payment path to another platform.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="mt-[clamp(5rem,10vw,8rem)] border-t border-border dark:border-border-dark">
        <section class="grid grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-12 border-b border-border py-12 max-sm:grid-cols-1 max-sm:gap-5 dark:border-border-dark">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-medium">Why it exists</h2>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">
            <p>Payment providers expose different credentials, request formats, status models, webhook formats, and operational behavior. Applications should not have to carry that complexity.</p>
            <p>Momobase puts a small, consistent API in front of provider adapters and keeps routing, transaction attempts, reconciliation, and operator access in one service.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="grid grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-12 border-b border-border py-12 max-sm:grid-cols-1 max-sm:gap-5 dark:border-border-dark">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-medium">Project scope</h2>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">
            <p>Momobase handles payment orchestration: collections, disbursements, provider routing, normalized transaction state, inbound provider webhooks, and operational administration.</p>
            <p>It is not a payment provider, merchant-of-record service, or hosted financial platform. Provider adapters and commercial relationships remain yours.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="grid grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-12 border-b border-border py-12 max-sm:grid-cols-1 max-sm:gap-5 dark:border-border-dark">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-medium">Principles</h2>
          <dl class="grid gap-7">
            <div><dt class="text-sm font-medium">Small surface area</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">Prefer a compact API and a modular monolith over a collection of services.</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="text-sm font-medium">Explicit operations</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">Persist payment state, expose provider health, and make administrative changes auditable.</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="text-sm font-medium">Infrastructure ownership</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">Keep credentials and transaction data on infrastructure the operator controls.</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="text-sm font-medium">Adapters at the boundary</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">Provider-specific behavior belongs in adapters; applications use one stable contract.</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </section>

        <section class="grid grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-12 py-12 max-sm:grid-cols-1 max-sm:gap-5">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-medium">Status</h2>
          <div>
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-7 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">Momobase is early-stage software. The current release is intended for evaluation, adapter development, and feedback rather than unreviewed production money movement.</p>
            <div class="mt-7 flex gap-5 text-sm font-medium"><a class="hover:text-brand dark:hover:text-brand-dark" href={repository}>View the repository →</a><a class="hover:text-brand dark:hover:text-brand-dark" href={`${repository}/issues`}>Open issues →</a></div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
